From 35b93a3ecd6a9f1bc8a6bc5dbe7d129ecb228b29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:53:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] libhegel: the draws a Hypothesis frontend needs

Ported onto 0.48.0 from the hegel-rust series: a weighted integer draw
that also carries shrink_towards (hegel_generate_integer_weighted), NaN
alongside finite float bounds, a text generator over explicit codepoint
ranges (hegel_string_generator_text_ranges), a live case's choices as a
reproduce blob (hegel_test_case_choices), a forced integer draw
(hegel_generate_integer_forced), and the diffuse integer pool built only
when selected. Header and frontend FFI list regenerated; C ABI tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016mTrLpQ8SJg9RC9F1GH9Ac
